      ("Shop kosher", "Buy meat, bread and dairy at Hypercacher, Lilly Market or the butchers. Pack a cooler bag."),
      ("Take our 3 hour Stopover", "Your own transport waits while we guide you in Vieux Lyon and inside the Grande Synagogue. 390 € per group of 1 to 5 people. See the <a href='../tours/stopover/'>Stopover tour</a>."),
